## 从 Input 到 Action：一条被 Gate 守住的主链

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  I([Input]) --> A03[A03\nData Intake] --> A04[A04\nSchema Mapping] --> A05[A05\nStandardization] --> A06[A06\nData Quality]
  A06 --> G1{DATA QUALITY\nGATE}
  G1 --> A07[A07\nHistorical Demand]
  G1 --> A08[A08\nAcademic Context]
  A07 --> A09[A09\nCurrent Validation]
  A08 --> A09
  A09 --> G2{CONTEXT\nGATE} --> A10[A10\nDemand Opportunity] --> G3{INSIGHT\nGATE} --> A11[A11\nCritic] --> G4{CRITIC\nGATE} --> A12[A12\nForecast] --> G5{FORECAST\nGATE} --> A13[A13\nAction] --> G6{ACTION\nGATE} --> O([Output])
  K[A02 Knowledge\n规则 · 记忆 · 留痕] -.贯穿全流程.-> A05
  K -.-> A10
  K -.-> A13
  S[A01 Supervisor] -.编排 / 回退.-> A03
  S -.-> A11
  classDef agent fill:#E8F3FF,stroke:#2F80ED,color:#17365D;
  classDef gate fill:#F3EDFF,stroke:#8B5CF6,color:#3C236F;
  classDef support fill:#E7FBF5,stroke:#22B79A,color:#17365D;
  class A03,A04,A05,A06,A07,A08,A09,A10,A11,A12,A13 agent;
  class G1,G2,G3,G4,G5,G6 gate;
  class K,S support;
```

**Input** 历史咨询数据　→　**Output** Forecast + Action Plan

