## 六个机制，让 Agent Team 成为可运行系统

```mermaid
flowchart TB
  R[Registry\n职责与边界] --- C[Dependency\n依赖与编排]
  M[Model Routing\n按复杂度路由] --- T[Agent Team Runtime] --- G[Gate\n结构化校验]
  A[Artifact\n产物可追溯] --- S[Resume\n从节点恢复]
  R --- T
  C --- T
  M --- T
  G --- T
  A --- T
  S --- T
  style T fill:#2F80ED,stroke:#2F80ED,color:#FFFFFF
  style R fill:#F3EDFF,stroke:#8B5CF6,color:#3C236F
  style C fill:#E8F3FF,stroke:#2F80ED,color:#17365D
  style M fill:#E7FBF5,stroke:#22B79A,color:#17365D
  style G fill:#F3EDFF,stroke:#8B5CF6,color:#3C236F
  style A fill:#E8F3FF,stroke:#2F80ED,color:#17365D
  style S fill:#E7FBF5,stroke:#22B79A,color:#17365D
```

